---
description: Verification and review rules
---

Before marking work complete, run the relevant checks in `agent_docs/testing.md`, review the diff, and update `MEMORY.md` for major decisions. For UI changes, verify in a real browser or device viewport. For AI/MCP changes, run the golden prompt, trajectory, approval, data-boundary, and tool-call checks. Report changed files, commands, evidence, risks, and rollback notes.
